# Coding Standards

Full reference: `docs/product-framework/CODING_STANDARDS.md`

**Stack:** Vite, TypeScript (strict), Bootstrap 5.0.2 via `src/design-system/`.

**Structure:** `src/app/`, `src/runtime/`, `src/audio/`, `src/visuals/`, `src/ui/`, `src/design-system/`, `src/presets/`.

**UI:** Bootstrap renders design system tokens. Import from `src/design-system/` — never hardcode colors or spacing. Follow `docs/design-system/COMPONENTS.md` and `PATTERNS.md`.

**TypeScript:** no `any`; explicit exported types; barrel exports via `index.ts`.

**Architecture:** UI never imports engines. Runtime calls adapters only. No engine logic in app source.

**Done means:** `npm run lint` and `npm run build` pass.
